  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "漫画『ドラゴンボール』の扉絵に登場したブルマのバイクが立体化！",
      "en": "Bulma's bike that appeared in the cover art of the manga \"Dragon Ball\" is now three-dimensional!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 高速で走る基本形態の「バイクモード」から、二足歩行形態の「バイペダルモード」や、不安定な荒野もパワフルに走り抜ける三輪の「トライクモード」へと可変！",
      "en": "• Variable from the basic \"bike mode \" that runs at high speed, to the \" bipedal mode \" that walks on two legs, and the three-wheeled \" trike mode\" that allows you to run powerfully through unstable wilderness!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• メカの精密なディテールを再現するとともに、“メカ不思議”な７つのギミックを搭載！",
      "en": "• In addition to reproducing the precise details of the mechanism, it is also equipped with 7 “mecha mysterious” gimmicks!"
    }
  ],
